('Classic layering can\'t avoid this tension: either the domain depends on storage (ORM classes), or storage depends on the domain.', 'That conflicts with a literal source-import ordering of this particular diagram. Layered separation can use mappers or dependency inversion; it does not require domain objects to inherit an ORM.'),
